<title>UK: Yokohama sets 120 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Yokohama sets 120 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers SBC Warburg, Zurich and Tokyo Mitsubishi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF YOKOHAMA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    120 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
